# Decode templates built here by `make compile-decode` (the decode_L<N> pair the
# per-token insts patch calibrates from). They live in this directory rather than
# fused_decode/ so DecodeInstsGen's decode_L* scan cannot mix them with another
# model's templates.
decode_L*.insts.bin
decode_L*.flags
